{"book":"Wisdom of Solomon","chapter":11,"cited_by":[{"kind":"case","label":"Menahem king of Israel","url":"/cases/08-divided-kingdom/menahem","verses":"16"}],"precepts":[],"moments":[{"verses":"15-19","label":"Bishop Nathanyel | Revelation 4 Kingdom Vision","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QxDokX4hfJY","date":"2020-03-08","teacher":"Bishop Nathanyel","video":"QxDokX4hfJY","t":3604,"ts":"1:00:04"}],"commentary":[{"verses":"15-16","passage":"Wisdom of Solomon 11:15-19","points":["The Egyptians were deceived into worshipping serpents void of reason and vile beasts. God sent unreasonable beasts against them for vengeance, so that they would know a man can be punished by the very thing with which he sins. The creatures they honoured became part of their punishment."],"note":{"label":"Bishop Nathanyel | Revelation 4 Kingdom Vision","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QxDokX4hfJY","date":"2020-03-08","teacher":"Bishop Nathanyel"},"ts":"1:00:04","video":"QxDokX4hfJY","t":3604},{"verses":"17","passage":"Wisdom of Solomon 11:15-19","points":["The Almighty hand made the world from matter without form. God did not lack the power to send multitudes of bears or fierce lions. His choice of creatures for a judgment is not limited by his ability."],"note":{"label":"Bishop Nathanyel | Revelation 4 Kingdom Vision","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QxDokX4hfJY","date":"2020-03-08","teacher":"Bishop Nathanyel"},"ts":"1:00:04","video":"QxDokX4hfJY","t":3604},{"verses":"18-19","passage":"Wisdom of Solomon 11:15-19","points":["“Or unknown wild beasts, full of rage, newly created”. Esau thinks he has seen everything, but Solomon, the wisest man, speaks of unknown creatures. They are full of rage; you cannot pacify them or tell them to roll over and play dead. They breathe fiery vapour or filthy scents of scattered smoke and shoot horrible sparkles from their eyes. The ideas behind creatures such as Godzilla did not come from nowhere; men have been reading these scriptures.","Their harm can destroy people, and even the terrible sight can do so. That is why seeing the heavenly beasts could make a person's spirit leave him. God has strange creations in heaven and earth we have not beheld. Think of the angler fish deep in the sea, with great teeth and a light on an antenna: that is only a glimpse of what is below, not proof that we have found it all."],"note":{"label":"Bishop Nathanyel | Revelation 4 Kingdom Vision","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QxDokX4hfJY","date":"2020-03-08","teacher":"Bishop Nathanyel"},"ts":"1:00:04","video":"QxDokX4hfJY","t":3604}],"people":{},"read":{"1":[{"video":"e1UVKraC1YU","t":1909,"ts":"31:49","title":"Passover 2024 Purge","date":"2024-04-09","teacher":""}],"2":[{"video":"e1UVKraC1YU","t":1909,"ts":"31:49","title":"Passover 2024 Purge","date":"2024-04-09","teacher":""}],"3":[{"video":"e1UVKraC1YU","t":1909,"ts":"31:49","title":"Passover 2024 Purge","date":"2024-04-09","teacher":""}],"4":[{"video":"e1UVKraC1YU","t":1909,"ts":"31:49","title":"Passover 2024 Purge","date":"2024-04-09","teacher":""}],"5":[{"video":"e1UVKraC1YU","t":1909,"ts":"31:49","title":"Passover 2024 Purge","date":"2024-04-09","teacher":""}],"6":[{"video":"e1UVKraC1YU","t":1909,"ts":"31:49","title":"Passover 2024 Purge","date":"2024-04-09","teacher":""}],"7":[{"video":"e1UVKraC1YU","t":1909,"ts":"31:49","title":"Passover 2024 Purge","date":"2024-04-09","teacher":""}],"8":[{"video":"e1UVKraC1YU","t":1909,"ts":"31:49","title":"Passover 2024 Purge","date":"2024-04-09","teacher":""}],"15":[{"video":"0ob1f4wJSUs","t":3567,"ts":"59:27","title":"Revelation 4: Kingdom Vision","date":"2020-03-08","teacher":""}],"16":[{"video":"zOfp7uGKYL4","t":5010,"ts":"1:23:30","title":"| SABBATH AFTERNOON CLASS: Only A Few Days Left!","date":"2022-07-23","teacher":""},{"video":"0ob1f4wJSUs","t":3567,"ts":"59:27","title":"Revelation 4: Kingdom Vision","date":"2020-03-08","teacher":""}],"17":[{"video":"0ob1f4wJSUs","t":3567,"ts":"59:27","title":"Revelation 4: 